Subject: [PATCH 1/2] stream.c: Rename STREAM's main

This allows to wrap `stream_main` in a top-level `main` with system
initialisation etc, as this benchmark was not designed to be efficiently
ported to different boards
---
 stream.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/stream.c b/stream.c
index 9bbd6ce..498ba4e 100644
--- a/stream.c
+++ b/stream.c
@@ -205,7 +205,7 @@ extern void tuned_STREAM_Triad(STREAM_TYPE scalar);
 extern int omp_get_num_threads();
 #endif
 int
-main()
+stream_main()
     {
     int			quantum, checktick();
     int			BytesPerWord;
